# This directory contains secrets for the master deployment.
# The actual secret files (*.txt) are gitignored.
#
# To initialize secrets on a new master node:
#
#   openssl rand -base64 32 > db_root_password.txt
#   openssl rand -base64 32 > db_password.txt
#   chmod 600 *.txt
#
# Then add db_password.txt content to GitHub org secrets as DB_PASSWORD
